From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:11:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j713: Start the keyboard backlight
 off

iBoot does not configure the keyboard backlight PWM, so there is no
state to keep and leds-pwm warns before falling back to off.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j713.dts | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j713.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j713.dts
index e2cabbab4a7a..40b46d5a34a3 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j713.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j713.dts
@@ -33,7 +33,6 @@ led-0 {
 			function = LED_FUNCTION_KBD_BACKLIGHT;
 			color = <LED_COLOR_ID_WHITE>;
 			max-brightness = <255>;
-			default-state = "keep";
 		};
 	};
 };
